    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n4219" root="توى" body-key="t">
    
      4 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اتواهُ</span></b>  <i>He</i> (God, M, K, or another, S) <i>destroyed it, made an end of it,</i> or <i>caused it to
perish</i> or <i>come to an end;</i> (S, K;) <i>he made it
away;</i> (T, M;) namely, property, (S, M,) or his
property. (T.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  See also art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تو</span>.


